      "content": "Look, I hear what you're saying about \"long-term health,\" but the marketing team is breathing down my neck. If we release him with these nerfs, the pro players will complain they're too weak, but if we release him as-is, the player engagement numbers and skin sales are going to be astronomical because everyone will be playing him. We can always patch him in a two-week hotfix once the launch surge settles down. Is there any way we can just skip the nerfs for the launch window to capitalize on the momentum? I need a definitive recommendation on whether we can push through with the current build as it stands.",
